+	<!-- custom: similarly, if you don't want to use the ObsoleteTech new XML field at all, you can disable it without having to tediously manually modify each entry one by one in XML, you can using this SAS define. If disabled (0), the value in XML ObsoleteTech will be ignored and always NONE (i.e. same behaviour as in base AdvCiv/Civ4). If enabled (1), the tech specified for each unit in its XML ObsoleteTech field will be applied e.g. NONE or TECH_BRONZE_WORKING for UNIT_WARRIOR for example. -->
+	<Define>
+		<DefineName>SAS_CV_UNIT_INFO_ENABLE_XML_UNIT_OBSOLETE_TECH</DefineName>
